# Smoke verify fixtures

This directory holds pre-staged files copied into a per-test install dir
via the `fixtures` array in a test JSON definition. Example entry:

```jsonc
"fixtures": [
  { "src": "tools/smoke-verify/fixtures/test_skin_redmund.pdmod",
    "dst": "mods/test_skin_redmund.pdmod" }
]
```

Source paths are repo-relative. Destination paths are install-relative
(so the example above lands at `<InstallDir>/mods/test_skin_redmund.pdmod`).

Add fixtures alongside the test that consumes them. Keep binary blobs
small -- the smoke gate runs on every PR.
